## Windows components

Windows builds use the unmodified official Wintun 0.14.1 amd64 binary through
its published API. The pinned archive is downloaded from wintun.net/builds;
its Prebuilt Binaries License is included as WINTUN_LICENSE.txt.

Windows QR image decoding and macOS/Windows QR sharing use github.com/makiuchi-d/gozxing v0.1.1 (MIT, with retained
ZXing Apache-2.0 terms): GOZXING_LICENSE.txt. Its golang.org/x/xerrors dependency
retains BSD-3-Clause terms: XERRORS_LICENSE.txt.

Windows network API bindings use golang.zx2c4.com/wireguard/windows v1.0.1.
The DNS guard's WFP ABI declarations follow its MIT-licensed bindings,
copyright 2019-2026 WireGuard LLC. WIREGUARD_WINDOWS_LICENSE.txt retains its
component notices. The Elarni guard installs temporary DNS and route-enforcement
filters owned by the elevated helper process.

